Package: RoyAIapp
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Research Platform for Generalized Roy Models of Human-AI Complementarity
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ibrahim", "Niankara", email = "Ibrahim.niankara@aau.ac.ae",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("BRASS Digital Lab", role = "fnd",
           comment = "LLC registered in Burkina Faso, RCCM BF-OUA-01-2026-B13-02466; https://brassbe1982-bdlweb.share.connect.posit.cloud/"))
Description: A Shiny application built on the 'RoyAI' package. It offers an
    interactive simulator of the copula generalized Roy model (selection,
    ATE/ATT/ATU/LATE, marginal treatment effects and earnings distributions),
    estimation of Model A and Model B on simulated, example or uploaded data
    with comparison of copula dependence families, labs that simulate and
    estimate Model D (continuous AI-use intensity) and Model E (dynamic
    selection with learning), and a browser for the stored
    Monte Carlo and PIAAC results. The framework builds on Niankara et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.1109/GCET68529.2025.11450624>.
URL: https://github.com/brassbe1982/RoyAIapp
